# Copy this file to cmd.txt and the device will execute its contents on
# every boot (a U-Boot script, # starts a comment; when the file doesn't
# exist the device keeps using the SD-card fallback path)
#
# Example 1: lengthen the countdown and save it (from then on every boot can
# be interrupted into the serial autoboot prompt)
# setenv bootdelay 10
# saveenv
# reset
#
# Example 2: stall here after boot and wait for a serial Ctrl-C into the
# command line (no persistent changes)
# sleep 5
# sleep 5
# sleep 5
